<title>UK: UK Dec oil output up 20 kbpd to 2.73 mln - WoodMac.</title>
<headline>UK Dec oil output up 20 kbpd to 2.73 mln - WoodMac.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. oil production in December rose to its highest level since October 1995, totalling 2.73 million barrels per day (bpd), consultants Wood Mackenzie said on Monday.</p>
<p>This corresponds to an increase of 20,000 bpd on the previous month's figure and 100,000 bpd on the total for December 1995.</p>
<p>U.K. oil production in 1996 averaged 2.57 million bpd, broadly in line with 1995 output.</p>
